      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "SECURITY / DATA RULES: Auth owns credentials and identity. Application tables store only necessary profile and entitlement data. Users may read only their own permitted rows. Payment events never grant access from a browser redirect; verified server-side events update entitlement. Retention and anonymous event collection\nrequire privacy approval.",
